webCredential fusion-erp-oauth-cred (
    name: Fusion ERP - OAuth2 Client Credentials
    type: oauth2ClientCredentialsFlow
    authentication {
        oauthScope: PENDING-OAUTH-SCOPE
        clientIdOrUsername: PENDING-CLIENT-ID
    }
    advanced {
        tokenAuthenticationMethod: clientIdAndClientSecretInBody
        staticId: fusion-erp-oauth-cred
        promptOnInstall: true
    }
    comments {
        comments:
            ```
            Backs every outbound call to Fusion (fac_conn_get_pkg reads and
            fac_fusion_write_pkg's ESS job submission POST) - see plan
            discovery items #2 and #3 (the latter being the open SOD/
            compliance question on whether a service account may submit
            Create Accounting / Period Close at all). oauthScope and
            clientIdOrUsername are placeholders. This grammar's advanced
            block also has a REQUIRED authenticationCredential (COMPONENT
            reference) field for this credential type that isn't covered
            by any example in the installed skill - deliberately left out
            here rather than guessed. Finish this credential directly in
            the live APEX Web Credential wizard (or re-check with
            query-valid-props.mjs once tooling exists) before relying on
            it - do not treat this file as complete.
            ```
    }
)
